abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact for C-SDVR, a cost-aware runtime verification and
  local recovery framework for side-effectful software engineering agents.
  The repository contains manuscript source, experiment code, raw records,
  derived results, figures, and numeric audits for bounded and reversible
  file, form, record, workflow, and local Git-repository operations.
